    TEST-0009: list the tests the status command needs

    FEAT-0005 shipped the front desk's status command with no tests. These
    are the cases it needs: one for each of its five outcomes, plus the
    other side of the one-week boundary.

    None of them has a body yet, because none can be written against
    printStatus() as it stands. It works out the days left from Date.now(),
    so a test can only reach whichever outcome today happens to land on
    (nothing starts within a week of today, so S5 can't be reached at all).
    And it returns nothing, so even a test that reaches an outcome has
    nothing to check unless it catches console.log.

